From: Principal Engineer <review@prod.harden>
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] MEDIUM: Dockerfile runs API server, not CLI

The Dockerfile.agent was running the CLI interactive mode instead
of the FastAPI server. Running it standalone would spin up an
interactive TTY instead of an HTTP service.

--- Dockerfile.agent
+++ Dockerfile.agent
@@ -19,5 +19,5 @@
 HEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=10s --start-period=5s --retries=3 \
     CMD curl -f http://localhost:8000/health || exit 1
 
-# Run supervisor agent (with MCP server as subprocess)
-CMD ["python", "-m", "langgraph.agent"]
+# Run FastAPI production server (not CLI interactive mode)
+CMD ["uvicorn", "langgraph.api:app", "--host", "0.0.0.0", "--port", "8000", "--workers", "2"]
